        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>人民日报 2025年2月13日 第一版</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;background:#fff;}\n  body{font-family:\"Songti SC\",\"SimSun\",\"Noto Serif CJK SC\",serif;color:#111;}\n  .page{width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 14px;box-sizing:border-box;}\n  .hr-thick{border:0;border-top:2px solid #111;margin:6px 0;}\n  .hr-thin{border:0;border-top:1px solid #111;margin:5px 0;}\n  .hr-dbl{border:0;border-top:3px double #111;margin:6px 0;}\n\n  /* ---------- top header ---------- */\n  .topzone{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;}\n  .masthead{width:300px;flex:0 0 300px;text-align:center;padding-top:6px;}\n  .masthead .logo{font-family:\"STKaiti\",\"KaiTi\",\"Kaiti SC\",serif;font-size:76px;line-height:.95;\n     color:#d81f21;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;}\n  .masthead .pinyin{color:#d81f21;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:5px;margin-top:6px;\n     border-top:1px solid #d81f21;border-bottom:1px solid #d81f21;padding:2px 0;display:inline-block;}\n  .masthead .web{font-size:11px;margin-top:16px;}\n  .datebox{flex:0 0 108px;border-left:1px solid #111;border-right:1px solid #111;\n     margin:0 6px;padding:2px 4px;text-align:center;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5;}\n  .datebox .y{font-size:12px;border-bottom:1px solid #111;padding-bottom:2px;}\n  .datebox .d{font-size:38px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;margin:2px 0;}\n  .datebox .small{font-size:9px;}\n  .datebox hr{border:0;border-top:1px solid #111;margin:3px 0;}\n  .rightzone{flex:1;padding-left:4px;}\n\n  h1.head1{font-size:27px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-align:center;margin:2px 0 6px;}\n  .cols2{column-count:2;column-gap:14px;column-rule:1px solid #bbb;}\n  .cols3{column-count:3;column-gap:12px;}\n  .cols4{column-count:4;column-gap:12px;}\n  .cols5{column-count:5;column-gap:10px;}\n  .body{font-size:9px;line-height:1.55;text-align:justify;}\n  .body p{margin:0 0 3px;text-indent:2em;}\n  .ill{color:#333;}\n\n  /* ---------- vertical title ---------- */\n  .vtitle{writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-orientation:upright;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;\n     letter-spacing:3px;line-height:1.25;margin:0 8px;}\n  .vsmall{writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-orientation:upright;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;}\n\n  /* ---------- main left articles ---------- */\n  .mainflex{display:flex;margin-top:6px;}\n  .leftmain{flex:0 0 62%;padding-right:8px;border-right:1px solid #111;}\n  .rightmain{flex:1;padding-left:8px;}\n  h2.head2{font-size:30px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;letter-spacing:2px;margin:6px 0 4px;}\n  .byline{font-size:10px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px;}\n  .redbar{display:inline-block;background:#d81f21;color:#fff;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\n     padding:4px 14px;letter-spacing:1px;}\n  .barwrap{text-align:left;border-top:1px solid #d81f21;border-bottom:1px solid #d81f21;\n     padding:3px 0;margin:8px 0;}\n  .sect-title{font-size:19px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;}\n  .redmark{color:#d81f21;font-weight:700;}\n  h3.head3{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;margin:4px 0;letter-spacing:1px;}\n\n  /* ---------- placeholders ---------- */\n  .placeholder{border:1px solid #888;background:#f2f2f2;display:flex;align-items:center;\n     justify-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:10px;color:#444;box-sizing:border-box;}\n\n  /* ---------- bottom band ---------- */\n  .bottom{display:flex;margin-top:8px;border-top:2px solid #111;padding-top:6px;}\n  .b-vert{flex:0 0 66px;display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;}\n  .b-txt{flex:0 0 150px;padding:0 6px;border-right:1px solid #111;}\n  .b-txt2{flex:1;padding:0 6px;}\n  .guide{flex:0 0 168px;border:1px solid #111;margin-left:6px;padding:4px;box-sizing:border-box;}\n  .guide .gtitle{background:#d81f21;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;\n     letter-spacing:4px;padding:2px 0;}\n  .guide h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 0 2px;line-height:1.3;}\n  .guide .pg{text-align:right;font-size:10px;}\n  .caption{font-size:9px;line-height:1.5;text-align:justify;}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- =============== HEADER ZONE =============== -->\n  <div class=\"topzone\">\n    <div class=\"masthead\">\n      <div class=\"logo\">人民日报</div>\n      <div class=\"pinyin\">RENMIN&nbsp;RIBAO</div>\n      <div class=\"web\">人民网网址：http://www.people.com.cn</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"datebox\">\n      <div class=\"y\">2025年2月</div>\n      <div class=\"d\">13</div>\n      <div>星期四</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">乙巳年正月十六</div>\n      <hr>\n      <div class=\"small\">人民日报社出版</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">国内统一连续出版物号</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">CN&nbsp;11—0065</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">代号&nbsp;1—1</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">第<span style=\"font-weight:700;\">27977</span>期</div>\n      <div class=\"small\">今日20版</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rightzone\">\n      <h1 class=\"head1\">中央军委表彰全军备战标兵单位和标兵个人</h1>\n      <hr class=\"hr-thin\">\n      <div class=\"cols2 body\">\n        <p>新华社北京2月12日电&nbsp;&nbsp;中央军委日前印发通报，对10个全军备战标兵单位和20名全军备战标兵个人予以表彰。</p>\n        <p>通报指出，近年来，全军部队坚持以习近平新时代中国特色社会主义思想为指导，深入贯彻习近平强军思想，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，大力加强练兵备战，涌现出一批备战标兵单位和标兵个人。他们<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，聚焦实现建军一百年奋斗目标，扎实做好军事斗争准备，不断提高履行使命任务能力，展现出<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>良好的精神面貌。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，坚决完成党和人民赋予的各项任务。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n      </div>\n      <hr class=\"hr-dbl\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- =============== 从百分之五增长看定力与信心 =============== -->\n  <div style=\"display:flex;margin-left:414px;\">\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div class=\"body\" style=\"column-count:2;column-gap:10px;\">\n        <p>国有关于总值同比增长5%——2024年中国经济量重实现破口<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，增长实现新征程实现基本盘和新动能。</p>\n        <p>过去一个不寻常的成绩，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>——回顾这一年，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>透过这个5%，我们看到的是<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；透过这个5%，我们看到的是中国经济的巨大韧性和潜力。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:center;font-weight:700;\">（一）</p>\n        <p>这个5%，是在<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>的复杂形势下取得的。</p>\n        <p>“我们打各种复杂多面山峰起攀爬的举动不到而更，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。”</p>\n        <p>这是对“5%增长”的深刻注解。</p>\n        <p>回首过去，世界经济复苏乏力，地缘政治冲突延绵，外部环境的<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>不确定性明显上升。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>“5%”是重要的现实成绩。</p>\n        <p>这是我最重上的<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>——把<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>第三产业增加值比重<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；这是<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>的一个新增长点，130万亿元、<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；130万元的台阶上，中国经济走得更加坚实。</p>\n        <p>“5%”，是量的合理增长。</p>\n        <p>全球最新最快CR450动车组样车亮相，商业航天，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>新兴产业，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>——中国经济在<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>结构上不断优化，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。“5%”，是质的有效提升。</p>\n        <p>回眸<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，中国经济的增长曲线，是稳中有进的曲线，也是<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>的曲线。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>而在这惟一，得见出的十分测量占3046公里的哈尔滨广铁路一<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"vtitle\" style=\"flex:0 0 44px;\">从百分之五增长看定力与信心</div>\n\n    <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n      <div class=\"body\" style=\"column-count:2;column-gap:10px;\">\n        <p>渤海之滨，全球最大<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>项目开工建设，新的动能<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>一个更是上百人代表<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>电商务……相关于2024年全年数据接连下降5%以上，一个更是<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，中国经济不断实现新的成长。</p>\n        <p>不断跟高履行能力和<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，全面推进<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>面貌新能力，坚决完成党和人民赋予的各项任务。</p>\n        <p>坚持和<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>是保证的<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，中国经济<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>力量，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:center;font-weight:700;\">（二）</p>\n        <p>这个5%，是在<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>的形势下取得的，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。</p>\n        <p>一季度开局良好，二、三季度下行压力加大，四季度回升向好——2024年中国经济走出了一条<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>的曲线。</p>\n        <p>大国经济，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。2024年5月<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>“一揽子增量政策”出台，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。</p>\n        <p>一揽子增量政策落地生效，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，扭住“以进促稳”，是<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>的重要经验。</p>\n        <p>定投成果加大逆周期调节力度，方进大，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>为一系列“两重”“两新”政策，加力实施更多、更足<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>促消费、稳投资、稳外贸<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>着眼新旧转换，2024年设备工器具购置投资增长15.7%，其中<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>行业设备投资增长<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；着眼民生改善，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；着眼<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，5600万台，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>为一系列<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>的政策，我们看到，2024年GDP总量突破<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:right;font-weight:700;\">金&nbsp;社&nbsp;平</p>\n        <p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:right;\">（下转第六版）</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <hr class=\"hr-thick\">\n\n  <!-- =============== MAIN BODY : LEFT + RIGHT =============== -->\n  <div class=\"mainflex\">\n\n    <!-- ---------- LEFT COLUMN ---------- -->\n    <div class=\"leftmain\">\n\n      <h2 class=\"head2\">北京数字经济发展动能澎湃</h2>\n      <div class=\"byline\">本报记者&nbsp;&nbsp;潘俊强</div>\n      <hr class=\"hr-thin\">\n      <div class=\"barwrap\"><span class=\"redbar\">坚定信心，打开改革发展新天地</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"cols4 body\">\n        <p>拧紧、贴片、组装、检测……新的一年，新的希望，一条流<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>生产线上，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；工人智能<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，人工智能技术赋能下，各种自动化设备精准高效运行，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>习近平总书记指出：“要促进数字经济与实体经济深度融合，加快传统产业数字化转型。”</p>\n        <p>党的二十届三中全会《决定》提出，“加快构建促进数字经济发展体制机制”。</p>\n        <p>近年来，北京全面实施数字经济标杆城市建设，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>北京城市大脑第二期工程<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；智慧<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，数字化<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>“十四五”期间，北京<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，数字经济增加值占<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>产业数字化，规模新络腾，数字新技术赋能实体经济，在北京<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>加快布局数字基础设施建设<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，为高质量发展<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>数据是新型生产要素。新的一年，北京放大数据要素价值，加快推动数据要素市场化配置改革<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>国家大数据交易所，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>数据交易<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>数据资源<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>文物数字化，让<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；智慧医疗，让<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；数字文旅，让<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>2024年，北京数字经济增加值达2.7万亿元，同比增长7.7%，占全市GDP比重<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>数据要素市场化配置改革，加快数字技术<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，数字经济发展动能澎湃。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <hr class=\"hr-thick\">\n\n      <h2 class=\"head2\">绘就诗画浙江和美乡村新画卷</h2>\n      <div class=\"byline\">本报记者&nbsp;&nbsp;余建斌&nbsp;&nbsp;顾&nbsp;春&nbsp;&nbsp;刘军国</div>\n      <hr class=\"hr-thin\">\n      <div class=\"barwrap\"><span class=\"redbar\">高质量发展调研行</span></div>\n\n      <div class=\"cols3 body\">\n        <p>浙江杭州市桐庐县梅蓉村<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，江边的<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，村庄的<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>整洁的村道，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，村民们的日子越过越红火。</p>\n        <p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:center;font-weight:700;\">“千万工程”持续深化，加快建设宜居宜业和美乡村</p>\n        <p>习近平同志在浙江工作期间，亲自<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>推动“千村示范、万村整治”工程<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>2003年，浙江省启动“千村示范、万村整治”工程<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，从<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>做起，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>“千万工程”实施以来，浙江<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，人居环境显著改善，乡村面貌焕然一新。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>杭州市临安区<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，村民<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，正在<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>“在杭州，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。”<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>“<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。”<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>价养入影湖通话，2024年，聚居村梅蓉村植第积5.4万亩，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>全产业链产值超2亿元，带动1.2万人就业。</p>\n        <p>实施“千万工程”以来，浙江以村庄人居环境整治入手，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:right;\">（下转第七版）</p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ---------- RIGHT COLUMN ---