<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>从长远看，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，还要<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>从需求端看，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>；从供给端看，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>因此，无论主食吃得多还是少，我们都要牢牢<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>把中国人的饭碗牢牢端在自己手中。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- =============== BOTTOM BAND =============== -->\n  <div class=\"bottom\">\n\n    <!-- vertical headline block -->\n    <div class=\"b-vert\">\n      <div style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-orientation:upright;\">\n        <div class=\"vsmall\" style=\"margin-bottom:6px;\">重庆高新区积极推动科技成果转化</div>\n        <div class=\"vtitle\" style=\"font-size:24px;margin:0;\">科创经纪人，为技术和市场牵线搭桥</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"b-txt\">\n      <div class=\"body\" style=\"column-count:1;\">\n        <p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:center;\">本报记者&nbsp;&nbsp;李增辉&nbsp;&nbsp;刘新吾</p>\n        <p><span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>春节刚过，重庆高新区的实验室里，科研人员<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>忙碌起来。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>“科技成果转化，需要有人牵线搭桥。”<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>科创经纪人<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，为技术和市场牵线搭桥。<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p><span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>2024年以来，重庆高新区<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>培育科创经纪人<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，推动<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>科技成果转化<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span></p>\n        <p>科创经纪人<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>企业需求<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，成功促成<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>项目980万元。</p>\n        <p><span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>技术转移<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>，让更多科技成果<span class=\"ill\">[illegible]</span>走向市场。<span class=\"